SUMMARY:Deadline: Numun Fund: Seed\, Grow\, Sustain 3.0
DESCRIPTION:Numun Fund\, the dedicated fund for feminist technology infrast
 ructure\, opens its third Seed\, Grow\, Sustain call for feminist groups b
 uilding community tech\, digital security practice\, data activism and fem
 inist internet work. Grants come in three tiers matched to organizational 
 stage\, each disbursed flexibly over two years: Seed (USD 10\,000-20\,000)
 \, Grow (USD 20\,000-50\,000) and Sustain (USD 50\,000-100\,000). ELIGIBIL
 ITY: collectives of at least two people\; legally registered groups\, unre
 gistered collectives\, online-only initiatives\, and feminist-focused or w
 omen-led programmes within larger human rights or digital rights organisat
 ions all qualify\, but individual applications are not supported. The fund
  prioritizes organising rooted in the Larger Majority World (Africa\, Asia
 \, WANA\, Latin America\, the Caribbean\, Pacific Islands\, Eastern Europe
  and Central Asia)\; groups in the Global North are eligible only if led b
 y Indigenous or migrant communities. Deadline: 6 September 2026.\n\nOrgani
 sation: Numun Fund\nLocation: Larger Majority World (Africa\, Asia\, WANA\
 , Latin America\, Caribbean\, Pacific\, Eastern Europe and Central Asia)\n
 Award: Three tiers over two years: Seed USD 10\,000-20\,000\; Grow USD 20\
 ,000-50\,000\; Sustain USD 50\,000-100\,000\nDuration: Two-year funding pe
 riod\n\nMore: https://numun.fund/sgs3/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantde
 sk&utm_medium=referral
